{"name":"Whispering Oaks","hex":"#536151","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"whispering","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of whisper"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["That whispers.","Associated with whispers. (Can we add an example for this sense?)"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/whispering"},{"term":"oaks","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of oak"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A stakes race in which entry is restricted to 3-year-old fillies."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/oaks"}],"entries":[{"title":"Whispering","blocks":[{"text":"Whispering is an unvoiced mode of phonation in which the vocal cords are abducted so that they do not vibrate; air passes between the arytenoid cartilages to create audible turbulence during speech. Supralaryngeal articulation remains the same as in normal speech."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whispering"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Two_Girls%2C_Tigray_%2814991776680%29.jpg/500px-Two_Girls%2C_Tigray_%2814991776680%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Two_Girls%2C_Tigray_%2814991776680%29.jpg/500px-Two_Girls%2C_Tigray_%2814991776680%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A girl whispers to another girl.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATwo_Girls%2C_Tigray_(14991776680).jpg"}],"sounds":{"whispering":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/En-us-whispering.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/En-us-whispering.ogg/En-us-whispering.ogg.mp3"}]}}}